# 📊 Event Feedback Analysis using Python & NLP

## 📌 Project Overview
This project analyzes event feedback data to understand participant satisfaction and identify areas for improvement.  
It combines numerical rating analysis with Natural Language Processing (NLP)–based sentiment analysis on textual feedback.

The project was completed as part of an **internship task** using **Google Colab**.



## 🎯 Objectives
- Clean and prepare raw feedback data
- Analyze ratings on a 1–5 satisfaction scale
- Perform sentiment analysis on feedback comments using NLP
- Visualize trends using charts and word clouds
- Provide actionable recommendations for future events



## 🛠 Tools & Technologies
- Python  
- Pandas & NumPy  
- TextBlob (Sentiment Analysis)  
- Matplotlib & Seaborn  
- WordCloud  
- Google Colab  

## 🔍 Key Insights
- Majority of participants rated events positively (ratings 4 and 5)
- Sentiment analysis revealed predominantly positive feedback
- Negative sentiment correlated with lower ratings
- Word cloud highlighted frequently mentioned feedback themes


## ✅ Recommendations
- Improve areas highlighted in negative feedback
- Increase engagement through interactive sessions
- Use regular feedback analysis to drive continuous improvement
  

